id=rezygisk_lsposed_srb_guard
name=ReZygisk/LSPosed Soft-Reboot Guard
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=slapah
description=Kills stale ReZygisk (zygiskd/zygisk-ptrace) and LSPosed (lspd) daemons during a KernelSU emulated soft reboot so the replacement service stage starts a single clean set instead of a double daemon.
